{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "kontur/global-fires-h3res8",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "Fire hotspot detections from NASA FIRMS (MODIS and VIIRS), aggregated by Kontur onto H3 resolution 8 hexagons (~0.74 km²). One row per hexagon and detection datetime, 29,687,749 rows over 13,172,526 cells, covering 2020-08-12 to 2021-09-12 (the 13 months before the 2021-09-01 snapshot). Mirror of the CARTO Data Observatory dataset `environmental_globalfires_glo_h3res8_v1_weekly_v1`, republished as GeoParquet with the hexagon polygons derived from the H3 index, hive-partitioned by quadkey level 2 (`quadkey_prefix=*/*.parquet`).",
